    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Off</strong> is a relaxing bug-squashing game with minimal pressure on the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is simple:</strong> squash bugs with your feet to keep the room clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to stop bugs from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Earn points for squashing bugs and compete with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Your extra effort will be rewarded and remembered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Fully compatible with Steam Input for a smooth controller experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Support:</strong> Optimized UI and gameplay for a great experience on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Off</strong> is a relaxing bug-squashing game with minimal pressure on the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is simple:</strong> squash bugs with your feet to keep the room clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to stop bugs from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Earn points for squashing bugs and compete with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements:</strong> Your extra effort will be rewarded and remembered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Fully compatible with Steam Input for a smooth controller experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Support:</strong> Optimized UI and gameplay for a great experience on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul>",
